**Contact:** `mob_no`, `mobNo`, `mobile`, `mobile_number`, `phone`, `user_phone`, `phone_no`, `mail`, `email`, `email_id`, `user_email`, `contact_email`.

**Identity:** `full_name`, `fname`, `first_name`, `last_name`, `customer_name`, `applicant_name`, `dob`, `birth_date`, `date_of_birth`, `birthdate`, `aadhaar`, `aadhaar_number`, `pan`, `pan_number`.

